@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Dia 2 - Inicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Dia 3 - Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Dia 4 - Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Dia 4 - Ver detalle de usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### Dia 4 - Crear usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laura Martinez",
  "email": "laura@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Dia 4 - Actualizar usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laura Garcia"
}

### Dia 4 - Eliminar o desactivar usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### Dia 5 - Probar body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/body
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Garcia",
  "email": "ana@email.com"
}

### Dia 5 - Probar params
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/params/25

### Dia 5 - Probar query params
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/query?role=ADMIN&isActive=true

### Dia 5 - Probar headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/headers
Authorization: Bearer token-de-prueba

### Dia 5 - Probar params, query, headers y body
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/users/7?notify=true
Authorization: Bearer token-de-prueba
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nombre actualizado"
}

### Dia 6 - Inicio desde cliente HTTP
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Dia 6 - Health desde cliente HTTP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Dia 6 - Listado desde cliente HTTP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Dia 6 - Detalle desde cliente HTTP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### Dia 6 - Crear usuario con body JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Garcia",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Dia 6 - Actualizar usuario con params y body
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Actualizada"
}

### Dia 6 - Request completa de depuracion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/request?source=thunder
x-client-name: thunder-client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "example": "datos de prueba"
}

### Dia 6 - Error de ruta inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ruta-inventada

### Dia 6 - Error de metodo incorrecto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Dia 6 - Error de JSON mal formado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
}

### Dia 6 - Header personalizado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/request
x-student-name: Jordi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Probando headers personalizados"
}

### Dia 6 - Actualizacion completa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Modificado",
  "email": "modificado@email.com",
  "isActive": false
}

### Dia 8 - Consultar usuario existente 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### Dia 8 - Consultar usuario existente 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2

### Dia 8 - Consultar usuario inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999

### Dia 8 - Consultar usuario con ID no valido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/abc

### Dia 8 - Consultar usuarios activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/active

