Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Lopez",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Dia 9 - Crear usuario con campos incompletos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario incompleto"
}

